{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_034_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:104048d591cb5b22da72fd01ad976454b0d1476025ec0cd19cfb9c7e294a365a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_034_22:5_02_034_22_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc697a6bef71a76104bf20f514ac7aa8fef2e7f1d3f0598cd2bf5920ee61d1bf",
      "text": "这是情人节的回礼哦！给，请收下♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_034_22:5_02_034_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:435f3cf5e1cf33aa7d08dd5956b249b18ab0e618ced1d918c501e3a5a401d238",
      "text": "跟你说哦，吃了收到的巧克力之后，\n工作上超级有干劲的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_034_22:5_02_034_22_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e50047164065fcc238d0bbb943193a338c6501cd18421d5a3f884dfe5c7fcfc",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー送的巧克力，\n说不定是魔法巧克力呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_034_22:5_02_034_22_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a109251f68cc3646f339363c10187b04b60c77d61746fcd668e142ebea78a75",
      "text": "花音也在这份回礼上施展了魔法哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_034_22:5_02_034_22_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:326ac477c39ea446d980d5f52d8d613a27e13efb06347e3a589f570abd12c9d6",
      "text": "希望你从今往后的每一天，\n都能充满活力！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_034_22:5_02_034_22_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15204254746a0eea08b7e00f02f0ee8c12790ac32e8ff59bbcfabff7d4694c39",
      "text": "花音的魔法灵不灵，等会儿记得告诉我哦～\n我等着你呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_034_22:5_02_034_22_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27294860c15f3fa77e707f76cabb8124898c5a5601936a3da760ad34ce6949d8",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n白色情人节快乐☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_034_22:5_02_034_22_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:537f8c6020cb1e512bfc1135443b454654adf6785aebca0156758f8dd3a4cd6e",
      "text": "跟你说哦，情人节收到的巧克力，\n真的超级美味的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_034_22:5_02_034_22_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a222a178d03e7af1f1d196cadd219352a0a35be3ca8f30ca5ce84a9df2a838f0",
      "text": "所以呢，花音想了好多该送怎样的回礼，\n最后决定送这个了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_034_22:5_02_034_22_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b04c8c44ceb01b0c667337f875e24db112c95e18827a848a0d322ea4729f686",
      "text": "我想你绝对会喜欢的哦～\n给，请收下♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_034_22:5_02_034_22_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36c8caf50c2eddfde61bbedb18a053f2879a725687ecfcc6d8174c069bbe264b",
      "text": "呐呐，快点拆开看看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_034_22:5_02_034_22_b:cmd-000040:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b9a4eadcf29abeacf9e60813bb0344a0111336313ccbe80c8b19ed2cde0c4b4",
      "text": "好呀！真是一份绝妙的回礼呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_034_22:5_02_034_22_b:cmd-000041:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53346a4f498c0571931bb2f9f6887baa40a7db1768280f4ce05f5981539a08cf",
      "text": "这是……！正好是我一直想要的东西！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_034_22:5_02_034_22_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac22ca83298881650cae7e1396bd6303c7900c3b19e353f59f43acf6a9b9021d",
      "text": "对吧？这可是花音超级努力挑选的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_034_22:5_02_034_22_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a4a8a11264ace03839d5531be909b188041eb0445dacf4ebaf7970d63d0bbd5",
      "text": "真的吗！？花音居然猜中了制作人\n想要的东西，太厉害啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_034_22:5_02_034_22_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4928182352202c7cdc21e2b86311fc0def89058e10e798bbb20a7e906b3e23b9",
      "text": "嘿嘿，你能高兴太好啦。白色情人节\n真是一个连送出礼物的一方也能变开心的美妙日子呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
